{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11109310","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11109310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1110931001:0":{"text":"붉은 바위의 땅이라니, 설마 크림슨 고원을 말하는 걸까요?","source_cn":"赭红的岩地，难道是深红高原吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2B9FDCC3914F958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110931002:1":{"text":"아니. 크림슨 고원은 북쪽에 있어. 게다가 그곳엔 커다란 트라이브 부족의 마을이 흩어져 있지. 사막의 발톱이 그런 곳에 본거지를 세울 정도로 멍청하진 않을 거야.","source_cn":"不，深红高原在北方，散布着不少大型蛮血聚落，流沙之爪不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x129EDA3A0DBB4BB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110931003:0":{"text":"세일린워터 마을에 버려진 상로가 있어. 험준한 지형에다 지진이 일어난 뒤로는 약탈까지 심해져서 그쪽으로 오가는 상단의 발걸음이 뚝 끊겼지.","source_cn":"咸水镇东边有一条废弃的商道，那周围地势险峻，地震后由于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6934DE9FB4BAFAD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110931004:1":{"text":"외지고 인적이 드문 곳이라. 예언한 곳과 비슷한 거 같네.","source_cn":"偏僻又没人，听起来像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3204B545F72083EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110931005:0":{"text":"사트라나, 고마워.","source_cn":"萨忒娜，谢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59CD5315A83AB90A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110931006:2":{"text":"... 아, 아니... 저건 뭐지?!","source_cn":"……不，不……！那是什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC30FE7B61D717FAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110931007:0":{"text":"... 사트라나?","source_cn":"……萨忒娜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC35258E1A17FFDE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110931008:2":{"text":"꿰뚫어 볼 수 없는 검붉은... 붉은 파도 속에서... 어두운 봉우리가 솟아오르고 있어요...","source_cn":"一片无法窥透的暗红……在红潮中……升起巨大的黑色尖峰……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EAE04EF16598D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110931009:0":{"text":"사막의 발톱의 위치를 알아냈으니, 의식이 끝나야 하는데, 사트라나가 여전히 예언을 하고 있어요!","source_cn":"她还在预言！明明已经占卜出流沙之爪的所在，仪式应该结束...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57240A251900E972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110931010:2":{"text":"사악한 기운이 검붉게 솟구치고 있어요... 봉우리가 하늘을 꿰뚫을 거예요...","source_cn":"邪恶在深红中涌动……尖峰将刺破苍穹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B52876B1FD406B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110931011:0":{"text":"그리고 모든 것이 무너질 거예요!","source_cn":"然后，一切将会倾覆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA98EA134FC165A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110931012:1":{"text":"윽... 으...","source_cn":"呃……唔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9941A9B1238C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1110931012":{"text":"윽... 으...","source_cn":"呃……唔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9941A9B1238C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110931013:0":{"text":"사트라나, 깨어났군요!","source_cn":"萨忒娜，你终于醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8436600235593C74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110931014:0":{"text":"조... 조금 전에 끔찍한 광경을 봤어요.","source_cn":"我……我刚才看见了可怕的景象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1096C8FAE455197E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110931015:0":{"text":"그... 검붉은 파도와 어두운 봉우리는... 너무 무섭고 끔찍했어요! 어째서 이런 미래를 보게 된 걸까요?!","source_cn":"那些景象……深红之潮和黑色的尖峰……又压抑又恐怖！为什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC88FFA73DEF6DDD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110931016:0":{"text":"더는 생각하지 마.","source_cn":"不要想了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FD5BAD0F34623BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110931017:0":{"text":"하지만 예언에서 본 모습은...","source_cn":"可是，预言里的情形……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4C27920834D91DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110931018:1":{"text":"예언은 일부만을 보여줄 뿐, 그 끝이 어떨지는 아무도 몰라.","source_cn":"你的预言只能展示一些片段，最后不一定是什么结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68DCC34074E1DCC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1110931019:1":{"text":"목걸이를 훔쳐 갔던 범인처럼 말이야.","source_cn":"比如，偷项链的犯人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A98BAEBAA22AC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1110931019":{"text":"목걸이를 훔쳐 갔던 범인처럼 말이야.","source_cn":"比如，偷项链的犯人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A98BAEBAA22AC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1110931020:0":{"text":"하지만...","source_cn":"但愿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1D841BC3B41BAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1110931021:0":{"text":"이제 어떻게 하실 건가요? 사막의 발톱을 찾아가실 건가요?","source_cn":"你们接下来准备做什么？去找流沙之爪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2386AC11E44D4114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1110931022:0":{"text":"응, 사람들을 구하러 가야지.","source_cn":"嗯。去救人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD29C17F06E463A62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1110931023:1":{"text":"프랭크와 끝장을 보겠어!","source_cn":"去找弗兰克算账！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49D9F6090C510489","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1110931024:0":{"text":"당신도 간다고?","source_cn":"你也去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B055C757388E64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1110931025:0":{"text":"우리의 목적은 완전히 다르니까 오해하지 마. 그냥 가는 길이 같을 뿐이야.","source_cn":"别误会，我们要做的事完全不同。只是恰好同路罢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9232A085D182BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1110931026:0":{"text":"... 저, 저도 같이 갈게요!","source_cn":"——我！我也要和你们一起去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x133F129A724F7C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1110931026":{"text":"... 저, 저도 같이 갈게요!","source_cn":"——我！我也要和你们一起去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x133F129A724F7C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1110931027:0":{"text":"잃어버린 친구를 찾기 위해서 수없이 많이 점을 봤는데, 거기서... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 모습을 봤어요.","source_cn":"为了追寻我失散的朋友，我之前做了好几次寻人占卜。在那些...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x57E0C04EAF358AE1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"잃어버린 친구를 찾기 위해서 수없이 많이 점을 봤는데, 거기서... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 모습을 봤어요.","female":"잃어버린 친구를 찾기 위해서 수없이 많이 점을 봤는데, 거기서... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 모습을 봤어요.","variant_male_record_index":"122297","variant_female_record_index":"122298","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1110931028:1":{"text":"그러니 제 친구를 찾으려면 반드시 여러분과 함께 가야 해요!","source_cn":"要找到她，我必须和你们一起上路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D11316036788CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:45:1110931028":{"text":"그러니 제 친구를 찾으려면 반드시 여러분과 함께 가야 해요!","source_cn":"要找到她，我必须和你们一起上路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D11316036788CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1110931030:0":{"text":"... 얘기 다 끝났어? 이제 가는 거야?","source_cn":"——你们终于聊完啦？这就要走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCEB99C9BC53A50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:49:1110931030":{"text":"... 얘기 다 끝났어? 이제 가는 거야?","source_cn":"——你们终于聊完啦？这就要走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCEB99C9BC53A50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1110931031:0":{"text":"나에게 누명을 씌우고 사과도 안 한 트라이브 동생에게 물어볼 게 있어.","source_cn":"找那位诬陷我不道歉的蛮血妹子，有事要问她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABCE4535D456AC35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1110931032:0":{"text":"... 흥, 사과라면 지금 하면 되잖아요!\n\"미안해요\", 이제 됐죠?","source_cn":"……哼，要道歉的话，我说就是了！\\n“对不起。”可以了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEF209E1D9DB04A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1110931033:0":{"text":"대충 때우겠다, 이거지? 뭐, 난 좀생이는 아니니까, 사과는 받아줄게. 다만 너에게 물어보고 싶은 게 있어.","source_cn":"马马虎虎啦，我也不是那么小心眼的人。不过，有个问题要问你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06316DF05592B7F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1110931034:0":{"text":"내 비밀 루트까지 다 동원해 가며 마을을 수소문했는데, 크림슨 고원에 숨겨져 있다는 보물이 뭔지 아는 놈이 하나도 없었어. 심지어 소문이 제일 처음 어디서 시작됐는지도 모르더라고.","source_cn":"我在镇上打探了一圈，还用上不少秘密渠道。结果，没有一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59DCAFD0C0F97BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1110931035:0":{"text":"그래서 말인데, 넌 그 점성술사, 선지자, 영매사... 뭐, 어쨌든 그런 걸 하고 있으니까, 네 직감은 어때? 크림슨 고원에 정말 보물이 있는 거 같아?","source_cn":"那么，以占卜师、先知、灵媒……不管什么身份，凭你的直觉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4003A44AFA7F084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1110931036:1":{"text":"제 직감이요?","source_cn":"凭借直觉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EA26BDA572972F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1110931037:1":{"text":"... 지금은 아무것도 느껴지지 않아요. 좀 더 제대로 된 의식을 치러야 알 수 있죠. 하지만 조금 전에 겪은 일 때문에 지금은 정신을 집중할 수 없을 것 같아요.","source_cn":"……我现在什么也感应不到，得进行更精密的仪式才行。但是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x292BA9E393716B54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1110931038:1":{"text":"흠... 역시 뭔가 수상해...","source_cn":"哼……果然有蹊跷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x546808B40A81C845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1110931039:1":{"text":"원하는 정보는 얻었으니까, 여기서 그만 헤어지자고. 너희도 해야 할 일이 있잖아?","source_cn":"我已经拿到想要的消息了，就在这里道别吧。你们还有正事要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAED002C42FEADFB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:49:0:1":{"text":"넌 왜 따라와?","source_cn":"你怎么跟过来了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x91C8C6BDAF2D9483","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"넌 왜 따라와?","female":"넌 왜 따라와?","variant_male_record_index":"63598","variant_female_record_index":"63599","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:45:0:1":{"text":"그래, 알겠어","source_cn":"那好吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x431BF44C68549FB2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래, 알겠어","female":"그래, 알겠어","variant_male_record_index":"63592","variant_female_record_index":"63593","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:45:1:2":{"text":"조력자가 늘었네","source_cn":"也算多一份助力","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D92C0FA40932600","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조력자가 늘었네","female":"조력자가 늘었네","variant_male_record_index":"63594","variant_female_record_index":"63595","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_ti